","romance":"destination","safari":"primary","ultra":"destination"},"commission_pct_low":15,"commission_pct_high":25,"commission_lane":["DMC"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane"},{"name":"Dawn hot-air balloon safari + bush breakfast","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"live","tier":"premier","price_band":"~$450-500/pp","timing":"Jul-Oct","draw_rank":1,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"adventure","when":"Jul-Oct","commission":"DMC/camp 10-15%","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["adventure","safari"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"primary","culture":"destination","romance":"destination","safari":"evidenced","ultra":"destination"},"commission_pct_low":10,"commission_pct_high":15,"commission_lane":["DMC"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane"},{"name":"Conservancy walking safari + night drive","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"live","tier":"premier","price_band":"~$60-150/pp","timing":"Jul-Oct","draw_rank":2,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"on foot with an armed guide and a spotlit night drive for nocturnal cats — both banned in the reserve, both a conservancy specialty","si":"adventure","blurb":"on foot with an armed guide and a spotlit night drive for nocturnal cats — both banned in the reserve, both a conservancy specialty","when":"Jul-Oct","commission":"camp/DMC","wells":["stay","move","activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["adventure","safari"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"primary","culture":"destination","romance":"destination","safari":"evidenced","ultra":"destination"},"commission_lane":["DMC"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"An Angama Mara / Governors'' honeymoon","si_tag":"ultra","status":"live","tier":"luxury","price_band":"~$1,000-3,000+/night all-in","timing":"standing; peak 6-12 mo","draw_rank":1,"hook":"the Mara''s apex camps — Angama''s escarpment glass tents over the plains, Governors'' riverine classics","si":"ultra","blurb":"the Mara''s apex camps — Angama''s escarpment glass tents over the plains, Governors'' riverine classics","when":"standing; peak 6-12 mo","commission":"consortia/Virtuoso + DMC","wells":["stay"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["romance","ultra"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","culture":"destination","romance":"evidenced","safari":"destination","ultra":"primary"},"commission_lane":["DMC","consortia"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"A Mara honeymoon (escarpment / riverine)","si_tag":"romance","status":"live","tier":"luxury","price_band":"on application","timing":"Jul-Oct","draw_rank":1,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"romance","when":"Jul-Oct","commission":"consortia/host","wells":["stay"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["romance"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","culture":"destination","romance":"primary","safari":"destination","ultra":"destination"},"commission_lane":["consortia"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"A Maasai manyatta visit","si_tag":"culture","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~$20-50/pp","timing":"Jul-Oct","draw_rank":1,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the Maasai homeland the Mara is named for — a manyatta visit, the adumu jumping dance and beadwork, with a fair-trade, community-benefiting operator","si":"culture","blurb":"the Maasai homeland the Mara is named for — a manyatta visit, the adumu jumping dance and beadwork, with a fair-trade, community-benefiting operator","when":"Jul-Oct","commission":"DMC/community","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["culture"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","culture":"primary","romance":"destination","safari":"destination","ultra":"destination"},"commission_lane":["DMC"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for in the Maasai Mara?","a":"Dangerous game and remoteness, not the parks. Lions, elephants and buffalo are at close range - stay in the vehicle and follow your guide; at the crossings keep to designated vantage points (3,000+ crocodiles). Ground EMS is limited, so carry AMREF Flying Doctors (~$40 pp/30 days, evac to Nairobi) + travel-medical insurance.","source":"flydoc.org","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"When is the best time to visit - migration or big cats?","a":"For the Great Migration and Mara River crossings, come Jul-Oct (peak Aug-Sep). For big cats without the migration crush, come Jan-Mar. The long rains (Apr-May) are lush, quiet and cheapest. Book 6-12 months ahead for the Jul-Oct peak.","source":"dumaexplorer.com","si_tag":"safari"},{"q":"Reserve or a conservancy - what''s the difference?","a":"The National Reserve has the classic crossings but more vehicles; the surrounding conservancies (community/private land) offer fewer vehicles, walking safaris, off-road and night drives - the more exclusive, often ultra, choice. Many itineraries combine both.","source":"masaimarareserve.com","si_tag":"safari"},{"q":"How much does a Maasai Mara safari cost?","a":"Reserve entry is $200/pp/day (2026 peak); a mid-range 4-day Mara safari runs ~$1,400-2,500/pp including the domestic flight, and a luxury 4-night peak stay $3,450-7,800/pp depending on camp.","source":"dumaexplorer.com","si_tag":"safari"},{"q":"Do I need a visa or yellow-fever certificate for Kenya?","a":"An eTA (Kenya replaced visas with the eTA in 2024 - apply at least 2 weeks ahead; required for all visitors). Yellow fever is compulsory only if you arrive from a YF-risk country (cert valid 10 days post-injection); CDC recommends the vaccine for most.","source":"en.wikipedia.org","si_tag":"safari"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Maasai Mara Safari Guide: Great Migration, Big Cats, Conservancies, Cost & Best Time","meta_description":"Plan a Maasai Mara safari - the densest big-cat country in Africa and the Great Migration''s climax: the Mara River crossings (Jul-Oct), reserve vs conservancy (walking, off-road, night drives), dawn balloon flights, 2026 fees and cost, with real safety, timing and evac intel.","slug":"maasai-mara-kenya","primary_keyword":"Maasai Mara safari","long_tail":["Maasai Mara Great Migration 2026","Mara River crossings best time","Maasai Mara conservancies vs reserve","Maasai Mara big cats","Maasai Mara safari cost","is the Maasai Mara safe","Mara balloon safari"],"search_language":"sw","local_keywords":["Maasai Mara","Uhamiaji Mkubwa","Mto Mara","simba","duma","chui","Wamaasai","safari ya puto"],"hreflang":["en","sw"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-31","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-31","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/kenya","read":"2026-08-20T14:53:50Z","source_updated":"2026-06-24T12:48:44+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"codes":["exercise-increased-caution","crime","urban-unrest"],"book_suppressed":false,"note":"the Mara is a well-run licensed-operator safari. Re-verify each cycle.","advisory_updated":"2026-08-20","advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-07-31","hits":7,"misses":15,"disregarded":3,"note":"Canonical 25-SI list; SAFARI is the launch/demo SI - primary safari not globaladv; balloon + conservancy walking/night drives = globaladv; sports limited to participant; spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"safari","name":"safari","status":"live"},{"si":"ultra","name":"ultra","status":"live"},{"si":"romance","name":"Romance, Marriages & Honeymoons","status":"live"},{"si":"globaladv","name":"adventure","status":"live","note":"balloon + conservancy walking/night drives"},{"si":"culture","name":"culture","status":"future","note":"Maasai"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Angama Mara - the escarpment apex","why_ultra":"glass-fronted tented suites 300m above the Mara Triangle, private guiding, the migration below - a Virtuoso value-add stay","earning":"consortia/Virtuoso","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~$1,500-3,000+/night"},{"name":"A private conservancy mobile camp + private guide + balloon","why_ultra":"exclusive-use conservancy camp, private vehicle/guide with walking + night drives, the dawn balloon","earning":"DMC/consortia","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"ultra","price_band":"on application"},{"name":"A Mara + Serengeti cross-border migration week (private-guided)","why_ultra":"follow the herds across the ecosystem, Kenya + Tanzania luxury camps, private guiding (mind the YF-transit rule)","earning":"DMC/consortia","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"ultra","price_band":"on application"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-31","hero":{"query":"Maasai Mara National Reserve, Kenya"},"geo":{"lat":-1.5,"lng":35.15},"orbit":[],"orbit_country":["amboseli-kenya","laikipia-kenya","samburu-kenya","tsavo-kenya"]}'::jsonb, 0)
